# NIKHIL//OS Web Edition — environment contract
#
# VITE_API_URL: the API origin (scheme + host, NO trailing slash, NO /api).
#   - Unset in dev → the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:8080
#     (see vite.config.ts), so the Contact app works out of the box.
#   - Set in production → the app talks to the live backend cross-origin
#     (CORS is configured server-side). If unset in production, the Contact
#     app degrades gracefully to a mailto: fallback (offline-first).
#
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.nikhil.is-a.dev
